{"seq":2,"slug":"prettier-deep-dive","title":"Prettier 深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/code-formatting-linting/formatting-principles/prettier-deep-dive","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"prettier-深度解析\">Prettier 深度解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Prettier 是一个&quot;有主见的&quot;（opinionated）代码格式化工具，它的设计哲学是<strong>最小化可配置项，最大化一致性</strong>。与 ESLint 等高度可配置的工具不同，Prettier 刻意限制了用户可以调整的选项数量，从而确保任何使用 Prettier 的项目都能获得高度一致的代码风格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Parser 选择]&#10;    B --&gt; C[AST 生成]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Printer 遍历]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Doc IR 生成]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Doc 求解器]&#10;    F --&gt; G[格式化输出]&#10;    B -.-&gt; H[babel / typescript / css / html / markdown ...]\">flowchart LR\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[Parser 选择]\n    B --&gt; C[AST 生成]\n    C --&gt; D[Printer 遍历]\n    D --&gt; E[Doc IR 生成]\n    E --&gt; F[Doc 求解器]\n    F --&gt; G[格式化输出]\n    B -.-&gt; H[babel / typescript / css / html / markdown ...]</pre><p>Prettier 与其他格式化工具的定位对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Prettier</th>\n<th>ESLint --fix</th>\n<th>gofmt</th>\n<th>clang-format</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设计理念</td>\n<td>有主见，少配置</td>\n<td>高度灵活</td>\n<td>零配置</td>\n<td>风格模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可配置项</td>\n<td>~20 个</td>\n<td>数百条规则</td>\n<td>0 个</td>\n<td>~100 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖语言</td>\n<td>JS/TS/CSS/HTML/MD 等</td>\n<td>JS/TS 为主</td>\n<td>仅 Go</td>\n<td>C/C++/Java 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现语言</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>JavaScript</td>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>C++</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>格式化方式</td>\n<td>完全重写输出</td>\n<td>逐规则修复</td>\n<td>完全重写输出</td>\n<td>基于模板重写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否关注语义</td>\n<td>仅格式</td>\n<td>格式 + 语义</td>\n<td>仅格式</td>\n<td>仅格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Prettier 的核心价值在于<strong>终结代码风格争论</strong>。团队不再需要讨论&quot;花括号是否换行&quot;&quot;缩进用 2 还是 4 空格&quot;等问题，因为 Prettier 已经做出了决定，而且这些决定不可更改（或只能在很小范围内调整）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构与执行流程\">架构与执行流程</h2><p>Prettier 的内部架构围绕<strong>管道模式</strong>组织，源代码经过一系列确定性变换最终输出格式化结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function format(source: string, options: Options): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const resolvedOptions = await resolveOptions(options);&#10;  const parser = getParser(resolvedOptions);&#10;  const ast = parser.parse(source, resolvedOptions);&#10;  const printer = getPrinter(resolvedOptions);&#10;  const doc = printer.print(new AstPath(ast), resolvedOptions, (path) =&gt; printer.print(path, resolvedOptions, print));&#10;  const formatted = printDocToString(doc, resolvedOptions);&#10;  return formatted.formatted;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolvedOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolveOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(options);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getParser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolvedOptions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(source, resolvedOptions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> printer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getPrinter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolvedOptions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> doc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> printer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AstPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ast), resolvedOptions, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> printer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path, resolvedOptions, print));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> formatted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> printDocToString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(doc, resolvedOptions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatted.formatted;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Prettier 的选项解析系统支持多层级配置合并：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OptionsResolution {&#10;  editorConfig: Partial&lt;Options&gt;;&#10;  configFile: Partial&lt;Options&gt;;&#10;  cliFlags: Partial&lt;Options&gt;;&#10;  perFileOverride: Partial&lt;Options&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OptionsResolution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  editorConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  configFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cliFlags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  perFileOverride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置优先级从低到高为：EditorConfig → <code>.prettierrc</code> → CLI 参数 → 文件级 override。这种层级设计使得项目可以设定基线配置，同时允许特定文件类型使用不同的格式化选项。</p>\n<p>Prettier 的解析器选择逻辑根据文件扩展名和内容推断：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入文件] --&gt; B{检查 --parser 选项}&#10;    B --&gt;|已指定| C[使用指定解析器]&#10;    B --&gt;|未指定| D{检查文件扩展名}&#10;    D --&gt; E[.ts/.tsx → typescript]&#10;    D --&gt; F[.css/.scss → css/scss]&#10;    D --&gt; G[.html/.vue → html/vue]&#10;    D --&gt; H[.md/.mdx → markdown/mdx]&#10;    D --&gt; I[.json → json]&#10;    D --&gt; J[.js/.jsx → babel]\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入文件] --&gt; B{检查 --parser 选项}\n    B --&gt;|已指定| C[使用指定解析器]\n    B --&gt;|未指定| D{检查文件扩展名}\n    D --&gt; E[.ts/.tsx → typescript]\n    D --&gt; F[.css/.scss → css/scss]\n    D --&gt; G[.html/.vue → html/vue]\n    D --&gt; H[.md/.mdx → markdown/mdx]\n    D --&gt; I[.json → json]\n    D --&gt; J[.js/.jsx → babel]</pre><h2 id=\"核心配置项深度解读\">核心配置项深度解读</h2><p>Prettier 的配置项虽少，但每一项都经过深思熟虑。理解这些选项背后的设计考量有助于做出合理选择。</p>\n<p><strong>printWidth（默认 80）</strong>：这不是一个硬性的行宽限制，而是格式化引擎的<strong>优化目标</strong>。Prettier 会尽量将代码控制在 printWidth 以内，但不会为此牺牲可读性。例如，一个很长的字符串字面量不会被截断。</p>\n<p><strong>tabWidth 与 useTabs</strong>：控制缩进的视觉宽度和物理字符。<code>tabWidth: 2</code> + <code>useTabs: false</code> 是 JavaScript 社区最主流的选择，而 Go 社区倾向于使用 Tab。</p>\n<p><strong>trailingComma</strong>：从 v3 开始默认为 <code>&quot;all&quot;</code>，即在所有合法位置添加尾逗号。这一选择的理由是：尾逗号使得 git diff 更清晰，添加新元素时只需增加一行而不会修改前一行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const config: PrettierConfig = {&#10;  printWidth: 80,&#10;  tabWidth: 2,&#10;  useTabs: false,&#10;  semi: true,&#10;  singleQuote: false,&#10;  trailingComma: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;  bracketSpacing: true,&#10;  bracketSameLine: false,&#10;  arrowParens: &#39;always&#39;,&#10;  proseWrap: &#39;preserve&#39;,&#10;  htmlWhitespaceSensitivity: &#39;css&#39;,&#10;  endOfLine: &#39;lf&#39;,&#10;  singleAttributePerLine: false,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrettierConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  printWidth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tabWidth: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  useTabs: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  semi: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  singleQuote: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trailingComma: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bracketSpacing: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bracketSameLine: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  arrowParens: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'always'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  proseWrap: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'preserve'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  htmlWhitespaceSensitivity: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'css'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  endOfLine: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  singleAttributePerLine: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>争议程度</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>semi</td>\n<td>true</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>保持默认，除非团队全员认同无分号风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>singleQuote</td>\n<td>false</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>JavaScript 社区偏好 true，但两者皆可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trailingComma</td>\n<td>&quot;all&quot;</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>v3 默认，对 diff 友好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>printWidth</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>80-120 均可，超过 120 可读性下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>arrowParens</td>\n<td>&quot;always&quot;</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>保持默认，对 TypeScript 泛型更友好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"插件系统与语言扩展\">插件系统与语言扩展</h2><p>Prettier 的插件系统允许第三方为新语言添加格式化支持。每个插件本质上是一个实现了特定接口的 npm 包。</p>\n<div cl